WEBVTT

00:08:28.496 --> 00:08:31.579
that my seat at that table
had proved pivotal

00:08:31.621 --> 00:08:33.746
to the success of our work together.

00:08:34.412 --> 00:08:37.037
Excitedly, I felt a lightness,

00:08:37.079 --> 00:08:41.037
ideating alongside my colleagues
without reserve.

00:08:41.079 --> 00:08:43.704
The work was riveting.

00:08:43.746 --> 00:08:47.204
So I opted outside
of my usual guardedness.

00:08:47.246 --> 00:08:48.996
I stopped hiding my opinions.

00:08:49.037 --> 00:08:51.454
I worried less
about those constricted norms

00:08:51.496 --> 00:08:53.579
of how I should express myself.

00:08:54.912 --> 00:08:57.412
For the first time, I felt like --

00:08:57.454 --> 00:09:00.579
Like I could take off that costume